bpftune (0.4.27) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Re-anchor best_i/best_v on every ESTABLISHED.  The incremental
    tracker in the vote path only compares best against second, so a
    third algorithm can drift into a lower position without ever being
    promoted through the pair.  Observed on the fleet as best_i
    disagreeing with the top-3 output.  Fix persists minindex and
    metric_min (already computed by the existing selection loop) into
    remote_host->best_i/best_v.  No new variables — an earlier attempt
    with an explicit min2index blew the 1M insn verifier budget.

